# 🏆 Composite Scoring Systems

Aggregate scores derived from ~110 raw fields across 12 schemas. All composite scores are normalized to **0–100**.

---

## 1. 🌅 Daily Wellness Score
> *"How healthy was my day overall?"*

| Component | Source Schema | Fields Used | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Energy Avg | Health Log | morning + midday + evening energy | 15% |
| Sleep Quality | Health Log | sleep_quality, total_sleep_hours vs goal | 20% |
| Mood Avg | Mood Entries | mood, calmness, confidence, motivation | 15% |
| Negative Symptoms (inv.) | Mood Entries + Health | anxiety, stress, brain_fog, sickness, headache_intensity | 15% |
| Physical State (inv.) | Health Log | soreness, stiffness, physical_fatigue, stomach_discomfort | 15% |
| Hydration & Digestion | Health Log | hydration_level, digestion_quality | 10% |
| Mindfulness | Mood Entries | mindfulness | 10% |

```
Formula:
  positives = avg(energy_avg, sleep_quality, mood_avg, hydration_digestion, mindfulness)
  negatives = avg(anxiety, stress, brain_fog, soreness, headache...)
  
  daily_wellness = (weighted_positives × 0.6) + ((10 - weighted_negatives) × 0.4)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

---

## 2. ⚡ Productivity Index
> *"How productive was this work session / day?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Focus | Work Session | focus_level | 20% |
| Output Quality | Work Session | output_score | 20% |
| Goal Adherence | Work Session | total_work_minutes today vs daily_work_goal | 20% |
| Efficiency | Work Session | productive_time / duration | 15% |
| Mental State | Work Session | clarity, motivation, (10 - tiredness) | 15% |
| Distraction Control | Work Session | (10 - distraction_count normalized) | 10% |

```
Formula:
  goal_adherence = min(10, (total_work_today / daily_goal_minutes) × 10)
    // caps at 10 — meeting 100% of goal = full marks, no bonus for overtime
    // e.g. goal = 6hrs, worked 4.5hrs → (270/360) × 10 = 7.5

  productivity_index = (focus × 0.20) + (output × 0.20) + (goal_adherence × 0.20)
                     + (efficiency_ratio × 0.15) + (mental_avg × 0.15)
                     + (distraction_control × 0.10)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

**Daily aggregation**: Sum all work session durations → compare against daily goal for Goal Adherence. Average other per-session scores weighted by duration.

---

## 3. 🧘 Spiritual Score
> *"How deep was my spiritual practice today?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Meditation Depth | Meditation | depth_level, focus_%, calmness_after | 30% |
| Devotion Intensity | Devotion | bhakti_felt, divine_connection, surrender_felt | 25% |
| Inner Peace | Both | sense_of_peace, sense_of_presence, gratitude_level | 20% |
| Stress Reduction | Both | stress_delta (pre - post) | 15% |
| Consistency Bonus | Both | did_meditate + did_devotion today? | 10% |

```
Formula:
  med_score = avg(depth, focus_pct/10, calmness_after)
  dev_score = avg(bhakti, divine_connection, surrender)
  peace_score = avg(sense_of_peace, sense_of_presence, gratitude)
  stress_relief = avg(stress_deltas across sessions)  // higher = better
  consistency = (did_meditate ? 5 : 0) + (did_devotion ? 5 : 0)

  spiritual_score = (med × 0.30) + (dev × 0.25) + (peace × 0.20) 
                  + (stress_relief × 0.15) + (consistency × 0.10)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

---

## 4. 🧠 Mental Health Score
> *"How is my mental state right now / today?"*

| Component | Source | Fields (positive ↑ / negative ↓) | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Mood & Calm | Mood Entries | mood ↑, calmness ↑ | 25% |
| Clarity & Focus | Mood + Health | mental_clarity ↑, (brain_fog ↓ inverted) | 20% |
| Emotional Balance | Mood Entries | (anxiety ↓), (frustration ↓), (overthinking ↓), (stress ↓) | 25% |
| Drive | Mood Entries | motivation ↑, confidence ↑ | 15% |
| Fatigue (inv.) | Health + Mood | mental_fatigue ↓, tiredness ↓, laziness ↓ | 15% |

```
Formula:
  positive_avg = avg(mood, calmness, mental_clarity, motivation, confidence)
  negative_avg = avg(anxiety, frustration, overthinking, stress, brain_fog, 
                     mental_fatigue, tiredness, laziness)

  mental_health = (positive_avg × 0.6 + (10 - negative_avg) × 0.4) × 10
  → 0–100
```

---

## 5. 💪 Physical Health Score
> *"How is my body doing?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Energy | Health Log | avg(morning, midday, evening energy) | 20% |
| Pain (inv.) | Pain Log | avg intensity across logged pains | 20% |
| Recovery | Health Log | (10 - soreness), (10 - stiffness) | 15% |
| Digestion | Health Log | digestion_quality, (10 - stomach_discomfort) | 15% |
| Respiratory | Health Log | breathing_quality, (10 - cough_intensity) | 10% |
| Hydration | Health Log | hydration_level | 10% |
| Illness (inv.) | Health Log | (10 - sickness_intensity) | 10% |

```
Formula:
  physical_health = weighted_avg(energy, pain_inv, recovery, digestion, 
                                  respiratory, hydration, illness_inv)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

---

## 6. 😴 Sleep Score
> *"How well did I sleep?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Quality | Health Log | sleep_quality | 30% |
| Duration Accuracy | Health Log | actual hours vs goal hours (deviation penalty) | 25% |
| Schedule Adherence | Health Log | sleep_time vs target, wake_time vs target | 20% |
| Interruptions (inv.) | Health Log | sleep_interruptions count | 15% |
| Sleep Debt (inv.) | Health Log | accumulated sleep_debt | 10% |

```
Formula:
  duration_acc = max(0, 10 - abs(actual_hours - goal_hours) × 2)
  schedule_acc = max(0, 10 - (late_minutes / 15))  // lose 1pt per 15min late
  interrupt_penalty = max(0, 10 - interruptions × 2)

  sleep_score = (quality × 0.30) + (duration_acc × 0.25) + (schedule_acc × 0.20)
              + (interrupt_penalty × 0.15) + ((10 - debt_normalized) × 0.10)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

---

## 7. 📱 Screen Discipline Score
> *"How intentionally did I use my phone?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Intentional Use | Screentime | intentional_percent | 30% |
| Productive Ratio | Screentime | (productive + learning) / total | 25% |
| Total Time Control | Screentime | penalty if > daily goal | 15% |
| Short-Form Avoidance | Screentime | short_form_used (boolean penalty) | 10% |
| Late Night Avoidance | Screentime | late_night_usage (boolean penalty) | 10% |
| Unlock Discipline | Screentime | unlock_count (lower = better) | 10% |

```
Formula:
  productive_ratio = (productive_min + learning_min) / total_min × 10
  time_control = max(0, 10 - max(0, total_min - goal_min) / 15)
  short_form_penalty = short_form_used ? -2 : 0
  late_night_penalty = late_night_usage ? -1.5 : 0
  unlock_score = max(0, 10 - unlock_count / 10)

  screen_discipline = weighted sum + penalties
  → clamped 0–100
```

---

## 8. 🎨 Hobby Growth Score
> *"Am I growing and enjoying my hobbies?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Session Quality | Hobby Session | overall_session_quality | 20% |
| Enjoyment | Hobby Session | enjoyment | 20% |
| Immersion | Hobby Session | immersion_level | 15% |
| Progress | Hobby Session | progress | 20% |
| Focus | Hobby Session | focus | 10% |
| Streak Bonus | Hobbies | current_streak_days | 15% |

```
Formula:
  session_score = avg(quality, enjoyment, immersion, progress, focus)
  streak_bonus = min(10, current_streak / target_streak × 10)
  
  hobby_growth = (session_score × 0.85) + (streak_bonus × 0.15)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

---

## 9. 🛡️ Self-Control Score
> *"How disciplined was I today?"*

| Component | Source | Fields | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Screen Discipline | Screentime | autopilot% inverted, short_form, in_bed_usage | 25% |
| Work Distraction Control | Work Session | distraction_count (inv.) | 20% |
| Urge Resistance | Sexual Session | urge_resistance_attempts, conscious_control | 20% |
| Meditation Focus | Meditation | focus_%, (10 - distraction_level) | 15% |
| Regret Avoidance | Sexual Session | (10 - regret_level) | 10% |
| Schedule Adherence | Health Log | sleep schedule adherence | 10% |

```
Formula:
  self_control = weighted_avg(screen_disc, work_focus, urge_resist, 
                               med_focus, regret_inv, schedule_adh)
  → normalized to 0–100
```

---

## 10. 🔥 Day Score (Master Score)
> *"Overall, how was my day?"*

| Sub-Score | Weight |
|---|---|
| Daily Wellness | 20% |
| Mental Health | 20% |
| Productivity Index | 15% |
| Sleep Score | 15% |
| Spiritual Score | 10% |
| Screen Discipline | 10% |
| Self-Control | 5% |
| Hobby Growth | 5% |

```
Formula:
  day_score = (wellness × 0.20) + (mental × 0.20) + (productivity × 0.15)
            + (sleep × 0.15) + (spiritual × 0.10) + (screen × 0.10)
            + (control × 0.05) + (hobby × 0.05)
  → 0–100

  Rating Bands:
    90–100  → 🟢 Elite Day
    75–89   → 🔵 Great Day
    60–74   → 🟡 Good Day
    40–59   → 🟠 Average Day
    20–39   → 🔴 Rough Day
     0–19   → ⚫ Bad Day
```

---

## 📈 Bonus: Delta / Trend Scores

These aren't daily — they track **improvement over time**:

| Score | What It Measures |
|---|---|
| **Meditation Progress** | avg session depth this week vs last week |
| **Mood Trend** | 7-day rolling avg mood vs 30-day avg |
| **Sleep Consistency** | std deviation of sleep/wake times over 7 days (lower = better) |
| **Body Composition Trend** | body_fat%, weight, measurement changes over 30 days |
| **Habit Streak Score** | combined streaks across all tracked hobbies |
| **Pain Trend** | avg pain intensity this week vs last (lower = improving) |
| **Nutrition Score** | protein target hit %, calorie adherence |
| **Sexual Health** | avg gap_since_last trending, regret_level trending down |

---

> [!TIP]
> All weights are starting suggestions. You can tune them based on what matters most to **you** — e.g., if spirituality is your #1 priority, bump its weight in the Day Score.
